  "releaseNotes": "RELEASE NOTES:\n=================\nThe UI library for building fast and beautiful apps in WinForms, .NET, C#, VB.NET and Visual Studio IDE.\n\n* IMPORTANT PLEASE READ:\n- Back up all your projects BEFORE updating.\n- Read about the changes, enhancements and improvements BEFORE updating.\n- Contact us if you have any questions BEFORE updating your library.\n------------------------------\n\n⚡ENHANCED COMPONENTS:\n\n# Bindable Controls.\n- Bidirectional Synchronization across bindable controls.\n- Enhanced 2-way binding thus enhancing data flow in both directions.\n- Enhanced synchronized relationship between the UI and the data.\n- Automatic Data Updates within the Bidirectional binding system:\n\n\n🔥NEW COMPONENTS:\n\n# None",
